<div id="b3d021d2"><ol class="jIjgn7qoTMH3b4e0jW3j" id="breadcrumbs"><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/">Kristiania</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/for-studenter/">For studenter</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/">Utveksling</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/internasjonale-samarbeidspartnere/">Internasjonale samarbeidspartnere</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46">Polen</a></li></ol><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['b3d021d2-json'] = {"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Kristiania","link":"/"},{"name":"For studenter","link":"/for-studenter/"},{"name":"Utveksling","link":"/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/"},{"name":"Internasjonale samarbeidspartnere","link":"/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/internasjonale-samarbeidspartnere/"},{"name":"Polen","link":null}]};</script></div>
        <div class="Page__header">
            <h1 class="Page__title">
Polen
</h1>
                <div class="Page__intro">
<p>Her finner du informasjon om våre samarbeidspartnere i Polen.</p>
</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="Page__body">
        <div class="Richtext Richtext--wide">
            
<div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content"><p>Gå direkte til&nbsp;</p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="#aleksandra">Akademia Teatralna im. Aleksandra Zelwerowicz</a></li>
<li><a href="#WSB">Akademia WSB</a></li>
<li><a href="#Poznan">Poznan University of Medical Sciences</a></li>
<li><a href="#Silesian">Silesian University of Technology</a></li>
<li><a href="#Lodz">University of Lodz</a></li>
<li><a href="#chopina">Uniwersytet Muzyczny Fryderyka Chopina</a></li>
<li><a href="#SWPS">Uniwersytet SWPS</a></li>
<li><a href="#Varsovia">Varsovia University of Business and Applied Sciences</a></li>
</ul>
<p><a id="aleksandra"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="a24ead8a"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/e63c92880fec4e00b049cb48c2db053f/25381590872_346e946de1_b.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/e63c92880fec4e00b049cb48c2db053f/25381590872_346e946de1_b.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/e63c92880fec4e00b049cb48c2db053f/25381590872_346e946de1_b.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/e63c92880fec4e00b049cb48c2db053f/25381590872_346e946de1_b.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">The Aleksander Zelwerowicz National Academy of Dramatic Art in Warsaw</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg">The Aleksander Zelwerowicz National Academy of Dramatic Art in Warsaw er en liten, autonom statlig høyskole med cirka 400 studenter. Akademiet tilbyr masterprogrammer innen skuespill, regi, dukketeater og teatervitenskap. Et kreativt miljø tilbys for kunsteriske eksperimenter og forbereder studenter på karrierer innen teater, TV, og film.<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://akademia.at.edu.pl/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside om høyskolen</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/e63c92880fec4e00b049cb48c2db053f/fact-sheet-erasmus-academy-of-dramatic-art-in-warsaw.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fact sheet</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/user/CollegiumNobilium/videos" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Youtube kanal</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved høyskolen er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra oktober - januar&nbsp;<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - juni</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['a24ead8a-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/e63c92880fec4e00b049cb48c2db053f/25381590872_346e946de1_b.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"The Aleksander Zelwerowicz National Academy of Dramatic Art in Warsaw","htmlText":{"value":"The Aleksander Zelwerowicz National Academy of Dramatic Art in Warsaw er en liten, autonom statlig h&oslash;yskole med cirka 400 studenter. Akademiet tilbyr masterprogrammer innen skuespill, regi, dukketeater og teatervitenskap. Et kreativt milj&oslash; tilbys for kunsteriske eksperimenter og forbereder studenter p&aring; karrierer innen teater, TV, og film.</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://akademia.at.edu.pl/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside om h&oslash;yskolen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/e63c92880fec4e00b049cb48c2db053f/fact-sheet-erasmus-academy-of-dramatic-art-in-warsaw.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fact sheet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/CollegiumNobilium/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Youtube kanal</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved h&oslash;yskolen er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra oktober - januar&nbsp;<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - juni"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="WSB"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="02197e3e"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/6e48bb7d0baf42c1a4abb1398b8e5c17/img_0869.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/6e48bb7d0baf42c1a4abb1398b8e5c17/img_0869.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/6e48bb7d0baf42c1a4abb1398b8e5c17/img_0869.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/6e48bb7d0baf42c1a4abb1398b8e5c17/img_0869.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Akademia WSB</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><span data-contrast="auto"><a href="https://wsb.edu.pl/en"><span>W</span><span>S</span><span>B </span><span>University</span></a><span> </span><span>ligger i </span><span>Dąbrowa</span><span> </span><span>Górnicza</span><span> </span><span>i den sørlige delen av Polen, </span><span>bare 1 time med bil unna Krakow. Her </span><span>er det </span><span>mange fasiliteter</span><span> å utforske</span><span>, </span><span>blant annet </span><span>fine landemerker som </span><span>Rabsztyn</span><span> Castle</span><span>.&nbsp;</span><span>WSB er en av favorittene blant utvekslingsstudenter, med over 2000 internasjonale studenter fra 60 ulike nasjoner.</span></span><p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://wsb.edu.pl/en/erasmus/incoming" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-ccp-props="{}">WSB info</span></a></li>
<li><a href="https://wsb.edu.pl/en/student/your-stay-in-poland">Studenttilværelsen i Polen</a></li>
<li><a href="https://wsb.edu.pl/en/university/strategy-of-development/strategic-vision-and-mission"><span data-ccp-props="{}">Universitets 'core values'</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/6e48bb7d0baf42c1a4abb1398b8e5c17/wsb-fact-sheet-2026-and-2027.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-ccp-props="{}">Fact sheet</span></a></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-ccp-props="{}"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Semesterinndelingen ved WSB er som følger:&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;<br></span><span data-contrast="auto"><span>- Høstsemesteret går fra oktober – februar</span></span><span>&nbsp;<br></span><span data-contrast="auto"><span>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar til juni </span></span>&nbsp;</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['02197e3e-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/6e48bb7d0baf42c1a4abb1398b8e5c17/img_0869.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Akademia WSB","htmlText":{"value":"<span data-contrast=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://wsb.edu.pl/en\"><span>W</span><span>S</span><span>B </span><span>University</span></a><span> </span><span>ligger i </span><span>Dąbrowa</span><span> </span><span>G&oacute;rnicza</span><span> </span><span>i den s&oslash;rlige delen av Polen, </span><span>bare 1 time med bil unna Krakow. Her </span><span>er det </span><span>mange fasiliteter</span><span> &aring; utforske</span><span>, </span><span>blant annet </span><span>fine landemerker som </span><span>Rabsztyn</span><span> Castle</span><span>.&nbsp;</span><span>WSB er en av favorittene blant utvekslingsstudenter, med over 2000 internasjonale studenter fra 60 ulike nasjoner.</span></span></p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://wsb.edu.pl/en/erasmus/incoming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">WSB info</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wsb.edu.pl/en/student/your-stay-in-poland\">Studenttilv&aelig;relsen i Polen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wsb.edu.pl/en/university/strategy-of-development/strategic-vision-and-mission\"><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">Universitets 'core values'</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/6e48bb7d0baf42c1a4abb1398b8e5c17/wsb-fact-sheet-2026-and-2027.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">Fact sheet</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Semesterinndelingen ved WSB er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;<br /></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra oktober &ndash; februar</span></span><span>&nbsp;<br /></span><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar til juni </span></span>&nbsp;</span>"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
