<p><a id="SWPS"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="bd8ce690"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/c08bbebdd4414836ac1988946e83a1e6/uten-navn.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/c08bbebdd4414836ac1988946e83a1e6/uten-navn.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/c08bbebdd4414836ac1988946e83a1e6/uten-navn.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/c08bbebdd4414836ac1988946e83a1e6/uten-navn.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Uniwersytet SWPS (Szkoła Wyższa Psychologii Społecznej)</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://english.swps.pl/?_gl=1*2iqb9s*_gcl_au*MTY2NzAzNjM4NS4xNzY1Mzc4NzM2*_ga*ODU5NjgzMDcyLjE3NjUzNzg2NTk.*_ga_WD92PFT6KH*czE3NjUzNzg2NTgkbzEkZzEkdDE3NjUzNzk2ODgkajU5JGwwJGgxMzI5MDY5NjQ4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Uniwersytet SWPS</a> er et universitet med sentral beliggenhet midt i Warzawa, med kort vei til kollektivtransport og byens kultur- og servicetilbud.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://english.swps.pl/programs/review-our-programs/erasmus-incoming-students" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>
<li><a href="https://english.swps.pl/we-the-university/who-we-are/about-swps-university" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Om SWPS</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fWUqmUkRwVI" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Presentasjonsfilm</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved SWPS er som følger:<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra september - januar<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - juli</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['bd8ce690-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/c08bbebdd4414836ac1988946e83a1e6/uten-navn.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Uniwersytet SWPS (Szkoła Wyższa Psychologii Społecznej)","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://english.swps.pl/?_gl=1*2iqb9s*_gcl_au*MTY2NzAzNjM4NS4xNzY1Mzc4NzM2*_ga*ODU5NjgzMDcyLjE3NjUzNzg2NTk.*_ga_WD92PFT6KH*czE3NjUzNzg2NTgkbzEkZzEkdDE3NjUzNzk2ODgkajU5JGwwJGgxMzI5MDY5NjQ4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Uniwersytet SWPS</a> er et universitet med sentral beliggenhet midt i Warzawa, med kort vei til kollektivtransport og byens kultur- og servicetilbud.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://english.swps.pl/programs/review-our-programs/erasmus-incoming-students\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside for utvekslingsstudenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://english.swps.pl/we-the-university/who-we-are/about-swps-university\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Om SWPS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fWUqmUkRwVI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Presentasjonsfilm</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved SWPS er som f&oslash;lger:<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra september - januar<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - juli"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="Varsovia"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="fbf642af"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/c9c94dfb27fa4085b3d2ade14e7acee8/collegium-humanum-photo.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/c9c94dfb27fa4085b3d2ade14e7acee8/collegium-humanum-photo.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/c9c94dfb27fa4085b3d2ade14e7acee8/collegium-humanum-photo.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/c9c94dfb27fa4085b3d2ade14e7acee8/collegium-humanum-photo.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Varsovia University of Business and Applied Sciences</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://varsovia.study/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-contrast="auto"><span>Varsovia University of Business and Applied Sciences</span></span></a><span data-contrast="none"><a href="https://humanum.pl/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"></a><span> er å finne i hjertet av Polen, midt i hovedstaden Warszawa. </span><span>Omringet av alle fasilitetene hovedstaden har å by på, vil du i tille</span><span>gg finne </span><span>et miljø</span><span> </span><span>som fremmer tverrfaglig læring og personlig utvikling. </span></span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">&nbsp;</span><p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://varsovia.study/en/who-we-are/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">Varsovia info</span></a></li>
<li><a href="https://varsovia.study/en/mission-and-vision/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">Universitets 'core values'</span></a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/c9c94dfb27fa4085b3d2ade14e7acee8/factsheet-2627.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">Fact sheet</span></a></li>
<li><a href="https://varsovia.study/erasmus/erasmus-incoming-students/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">Exchange og søknadsinformasjon</span></a></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}">Semeserinndelingen ved Varsovia er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra september - januar<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - juni</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['fbf642af-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/c9c94dfb27fa4085b3d2ade14e7acee8/collegium-humanum-photo.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Varsovia University of Business and Applied Sciences","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://varsovia.study/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Varsovia University of Business and Applied Sciences</span></span></a><span data-contrast=\"none\"><a href=\"https://humanum.pl/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"></a><span> er &aring; finne i hjertet av Polen, midt i hovedstaden Warszawa. </span><span>Omringet av alle fasilitetene hovedstaden har &aring; by p&aring;, vil du i tille</span><span>gg finne </span><span>et milj&oslash;</span><span> </span><span>som fremmer tverrfaglig l&aelig;ring og personlig utvikling. </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://varsovia.study/en/who-we-are/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,